From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: V <61495413+kelo221@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:40:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] TedSid::loadFile: stop the voices before freeing their ops

Voices read the source's ops as they play, and loadFile freed them
without stopping the voices, which then read freed memory. loadFile now
stops them first, as the destructor does.
---
 src/audiosource/tedsid/soloud_tedsid.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/audiosource/tedsid/soloud_tedsid.cpp b/src/audiosource/tedsid/soloud_tedsid.cpp
index d2d1760..8e58d21 100644
--- a/src/audiosource/tedsid/soloud_tedsid.cpp
+++ b/src/audiosource/tedsid/soloud_tedsid.cpp
@@ -167,6 +167,8 @@ namespace SoLoud
 	{
 		if (aFile == NULL)
 			return INVALID_PARAMETER;
+		// Voices read the ops: stop them before the ops are freed.
+		stop();
 		delete[] mOps;
 		mOps = 0;
 		// Expect a file wih header and at least one reg write
